          "type": "question",
          "settings": {
            "question": "Can I put a glass pool fence inside my screened lanai?",
            "answer": "<p>Yes. The spigots fix to the concrete pool deck, so the fence can run anywhere on the slab, inside the screen enclosure. Measure the run between the screen posts and send a photo; panels come in many widths, and custom widths are available. The 46-inch panel gives the 48-inch barrier height the pool act sets, with gate hardware for the opening. Confirm with the building department which barrier rules apply to your pool.</p>",
            "pages": ""
